EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Well, thanks for hearing me out!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Hang on. I can tell you're totally
choked up.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}but you're HIDING it!
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Now I'm so sad! I can't leave
with you feeling like this!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Oh, forget it! I'm NOT moving!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Pues si te parece bien...{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Espera.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} ¡En realidad estás
superalterad{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} pero lo disimulas!
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}¡Pues no puedo hacerte esto
sabiendo cómo te sientes!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¡Así que me quedo!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Grazie per avermi ascoltata!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Lo so, lo so. Sei sconvolt{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}, vero?
Non serve nasconderlo.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Si vede che è stata una batosta!
Non posso andarmene sapendo che
stai da schifo!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}OK, allora resto qui!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Beni dinlediğin için sağ ol!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Bir dakika. Çok duygulandığını
görüyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}ama GİZLİYORSUN!
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Şimdi ben de üzüldüm! Sen böyle
hissederken gidemem!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Boş ver! TAŞINMIYORUM!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Bah, si tu le prends comme ça...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Han là là ! Que faire ? Que faire ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}J'annule tout, loool ! Pas le choix !
Je peux quand même pas briser ton
petit cœur, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} !
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !
